    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">There are <var>goblin_count</var> goblins, each with an integer amount <var>coins</var>. Their indices go from <const>0</const> to <var>goblin_count</var> - <const>1</const>.<br><br>For each of <var>round_count</var> rounds, the dragon chooses the goblin with the <strong>largest current <var>coins</var></strong>. Ties choose the <strong>smallest <var>index</var></strong>.<br><br>The dragon takes half of the chosen goblin's <var>coins</var>, <strong>rounding the payment up</strong> to an integer. Update that goblin's <var>coins</var> before the next round. For example, a goblin with <const>9</const> pays <const>5</const> and keeps <const>4</const>.<br><br>Print the chosen <var>index</var> for each round.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> Two integers <var>goblin_count</var> and <var>round_count</var>.<br><strong>Line 2:</strong> <var>goblin_count</var> space-separated integers <var>coins</var>, the initial amounts in goblin order.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> <var>round_count</var> integers <var>index</var>, the chosen goblin indices in round order, separated by single spaces.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\"><const>1</const> &lt;= <var>round_count</var> &lt;= <var>goblin_count</var> &lt;= <const>50</const><br><const>1</const> &lt;= initial <var>coins</var> &lt;= <const>1000</const><br><const>0</const> &lt;= <var>index</var> &lt; <var>goblin_count</var></div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">4 4\n9 8 5 2</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">0 1 2 0</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
